          "noMasteryClaim": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "guide-appendix-e",
      "route": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e",
      "sourceContent": [
        {
          "sourceId": "p2334",
          "style": "Heading1",
          "text": "Appendix E — šta radiš kada zapneš",
          "textSha256": "4b79830d715f79b0a75cb941472ba1cbe952cfe79a1453b8b45c1b09c8b984ed",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2335",
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "1. Reci tačno šta očekuješ i šta dobijaš.",
          "textSha256": "d0f187d8e02aa58f8b7b88f541e2485c1fdc65674465186933bca45f38f2efcd",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2336",
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "2. Smanji problem na najmanji primer koji puca.",
          "textSha256": "866b1802a1cbab9e9c2fa6fde9d3481419a38c2585bcef2a10bc7c5da1a4902f",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2337",
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "3. Ručno prati stanje promenljivih / request / DB query.",
          "textSha256": "eefb96bf32aaf4e754485f97df0ee4cf610e2878ec339945d63ef568e76019a9",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2338",
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "4. Proveri pretpostavku u dokumentaciji.",
          "textSha256": "9ae08a940877f0b40be9fef4cc6353f34857d8a0ee78f1340286e1a2ff1c3462",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2339",
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "5. Tek sada Hint Level 1 od AI-a.",
          "textSha256": "f79cfec4f3cea5d3fda493c3fd4035d08915ae1a6213ca4b12e006175a913d4a",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2340",
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "6. Ako dobiješ solution na kraju: zatvori ga, napravi pauzu 10 min i napiši rešenje ponovo bez gledanja.",
          "textSha256": "41a0e35b7aff2e986f5eda7b3188ccf0719fb9191e11348ad10f15264ac1c0d3",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2341",
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "7. Sledećeg dana reši transfer problem istog koncepta.",
          "textSha256": "d8a452c1292d6f35b27f199a04ad27d09abf89ccf611b1bcadaf1af46099f825",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-e"
        }
      ],
      "proposedInterpretation": {
