        }
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "guide-appendix-f",
      "route": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-f",
      "sourceContent": [
        {
          "sourceId": "p2342",
          "style": "Heading1",
          "text": "Appendix F — kada smeš da koristiš AI kao pravi productivity alat",
          "textSha256": "b82ca00c9c9032b84c048fade444ef33cfa00b1f361cfe43c07770f1611d769f",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-f"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2343",
          "style": "Normal",
          "text": "Posle mastery-ja\nKada si koncept prošao kroz najmanje dva samostalna zadatka i jedan projekatski kontekst, AI sme da generiše boilerplate, test skeleton, repetitive CRUD, config ili refactor predlog — ali pre merge-a moraš da razumeš behavior, rizike i testove. Cilj nije ručno kucanje radi kucanja; cilj je da budeš sposoban da preuzmeš kontrolu kada AI pogreši.",
          "textSha256": "71a0be9036a423a898787deb847d3473ade3c96cea4161926ce63cf9aafeaf0c",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-f"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2345",
          "style": "ListBullet",
          "text": "AI generiše 80 linija rutinskog mapper/DTO koda → dozvoljeno ako proveriš tipove, edge cases i testove.",
          "textSha256": "ef703b6af7c9d0c5df94c7dde029046f30bd57cb4911d3fd36e686d8b5e2f2c2",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-f"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2346",
          "style": "ListBullet",
          "text": "AI bira data model/auth strategiju umesto tebe → nije dozvoljeno dok učiš arhitekturu.",
          "textSha256": "a034729b60ba698e4296149fc4dc131a833920c55b2d66d62e9103090b7aac92",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-f"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2347",
          "style": "ListBullet",
          "text": "AI napiše testove → pročitaj da li testovi stvarno dokazuju requirement; loš test može potvrditi loš kod.",
          "textSha256": "f4d6aa11768f5c58691431335bbf40de5d82bfa58d091a87b372c33d7f91557b",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-f"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2348",
          "style": "ListBullet",
          "text": "AI refactor → prvo traži diff/obrazloženje; ne prihvataj veliku rewrite promenu bez testova.",
          "textSha256": "f4aaa00bd48918180b36b00fbac544e7df66c1a4c4b9e3888f8eae9a99be0582",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-f"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "p2349",
          "style": "ListBullet",
          "text": "AI debugging → daj logove i hipotezu; traži da proveri hipotezu, ne “fix everything”.",
          "textSha256": "b8919327bd4e2abf50e844bf79040f99647398f2fef068f1af2dab4360d3146e",
          "websiteLocation": "/course/software-engineer/guide/appendix-f"
        }
      ],
      "proposedInterpretation": {
        "status": "pending-user-approval",
        "tool": "read-only-ai-after-mastery",
